@startuml 使用案例2_5_送養刊登管理
title 使用案例2.5: 送養刊登管理

actor "管理員" as Admin
participant "AdminDashboard.vue" as Dashboard
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "permission_service.py" as PermissionService
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入管理後台 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 訪問 /admin/dashboard
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 檢查用戶登入狀態\n(authStore.user)
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 檢查管理員權限\n(role === 'ADMIN')

Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: loadStats()\n統計各狀態動物數量
activate AnimalAPI
loop 對每個狀態 (DRAFT, SUBMITTED, PUBLISHED, RETIRED)
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals?status={status}&per_page=1
    activate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animals(filters, pagination)
    activate AnimalService
    AnimalService -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM animals\nWHERE status = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
    DB --> AnimalService: count
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: {total, animals:[]}
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {total, animals, page, pages}
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
end
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: stats {draft, submitted, published, retired}
deactivate AnimalAPI

Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: loadAnimals()\nGET animals by status
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals?status=SUBMITTED&page=1&per_page=20
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animals(filters, pagination)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE status='SUBMITTED'\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
DB --> AnimalService: animals[]
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: {animals, total, page, pages}
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animals[], total, page, pages}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: animals[]
deactivate AnimalAPI

Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示統計卡片與待審核動物列表\n(包含動物名稱、物種、送養者、提交時間)

note right
  統計卡片顯示:
  - 待審核動物 (SUBMITTED)
  - 已發布動物 (PUBLISHED)
  - 草稿動物 (DRAFT)
  - 已下架動物 (RETIRED)
  
  動物列表顯示:
  - 基本資訊 (名稱、物種、性別、年齡)
  - 送養者資訊 (姓名、聯絡方式)
  - 提交時間
  - 當前狀態
  - 如有拒絕原因則顯示
end note

== 2. 審核送養 - 核准發布 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「核准發布」按鈕
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示確認對話框
Admin -> Dashboard: 確認核准

Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: publishAnimal(animalId)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{animalId}/publish
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token\n取得 current_user_id
AnimalBlueprint -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = ?
DB --> AnimalBlueprint: current_user

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: publish_animal(animal_id, admin)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> AnimalService: animal

AnimalService -> PermissionService: can_publish_animal(admin, animal)
activate PermissionService
PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查 admin.role == 'ADMIN'
PermissionService --> AnimalService: True
deactivate PermissionService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證狀態\n(不能是 PUBLISHED)
AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status = 'PUBLISHED', updated_at = NOW()\nWHERE animal_id = ?
DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功

AnimalService -> NotificationService: create_notification(\ntype='ANIMAL_PUBLISHED',\nuser_id=animal.created_by,\nrelated_id=animal_id,\nmessage='您的送養刊登已通過審核')
activate NotificationService
NotificationService -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(type, user_id, related_animal_id, message, is_read, created_at)
DB --> NotificationService: notification created
NotificationService --> AnimalService: notification
deactivate NotificationService

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal (已發布)
deactivate AnimalService

AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {'message': '動物已發布', 'animal': animal.to_dict()}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: success response
deactivate AnimalAPI

Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示成功提示
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals() 重新載入列表
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadStats() 更新統計
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示「動物已發布」訊息\n列表已更新

note right
  核准發布流程:
  1. 權限檢查 (必須是管理員)
  2. 狀態驗證 (不能重複發布)
  3. 更新狀態為 PUBLISHED
  4. 發送通知給送養者
  5. 更新前端列表
end note

== 3. 審核送養 - 拒絕批准 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「不核准」按鈕
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: openRejectModal(animalId)\n顯示拒絕原因 Modal
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示拒絕原因輸入表單

Admin -> Dashboard: 填寫拒絕原因\n(必填欄位)
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「確認拒絕」

Dashboard -> Dashboard: 驗證拒絕原因不為空
Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: rejectAnimal(animalId, rejectionReason)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{animalId}/reject\n{rejection_reason: "..."}
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token\n取得 current_user
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 驗證拒絕原因不為空

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: reject_animal(animal_id, admin, rejection_reason)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> AnimalService: animal

AnimalService -> PermissionService: can_reject_animal(admin, animal)
activate PermissionService
PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查 admin.role == 'ADMIN'
PermissionService --> AnimalService: True
deactivate PermissionService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證狀態必須是 SUBMITTED
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證拒絕原因不為空

AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status = 'DRAFT',\n    rejection_reason = ?,\n    rejected_by = ?,\n    rejected_at = NOW(),\n    updated_at = NOW()\nWHERE animal_id = ?
DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功

AnimalService -> NotificationService: create_notification(\ntype='ANIMAL_REJECTED',\nuser_id=animal.created_by,\nrelated_id=animal_id,\nmessage='您的送養刊登未通過審核')
activate NotificationService
NotificationService -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(type, user_id, related_animal_id, message, is_read)
DB --> NotificationService: notification created
NotificationService --> AnimalService: notification
deactivate NotificationService

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal (已拒絕)
deactivate AnimalService

AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {'message': '已拒絕批准,動物狀態改為草稿', 'animal': animal.to_dict()}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: success response
deactivate AnimalAPI

Dashboard -> Dashboard: closeRejectModal()\n關閉 Modal
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示成功提示
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals() 重新載入列表
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadStats() 更新統計
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示「已拒絕批准,並已通知送養者」\n列表已更新
deactivate Dashboard

note right
  拒絕批准流程:
  1. 權限檢查 (必須是管理員)
  2. 狀態驗證 (只能拒絕 SUBMITTED)
  3. 拒絕原因必填
  4. 更新狀態為 DRAFT
  5. 記錄拒絕原因、拒絕者、拒絕時間
  6. 發送通知給送養者
  7. 送養者可修改後重新提交
end note

== 4. 下架送養刊登 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 切換到「已發布」頁籤\n(currentStatus = 'PUBLISHED')
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: loadAnimals(status='PUBLISHED')
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals?status=PUBLISHED
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animals(filters)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE status='PUBLISHED'\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> AnimalService: animals[]
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animals[]
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animals[], total}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: animals[]
deactivate AnimalAPI
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示已發布的動物列表

Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「下架」按鈕
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示確認對話框
Admin -> Dashboard: 確認下架

Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: retireAnimal(animalId)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{animalId}/retire
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token\n取得 current_user

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: retire_animal(animal_id, user)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> AnimalService: animal

AnimalService -> PermissionService: can_retire_animal(user, animal)
activate PermissionService
PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查 user.role == 'ADMIN'\nOR user.user_id == animal.created_by
PermissionService --> AnimalService: True
deactivate PermissionService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證狀態必須是 PUBLISHED
AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status = 'RETIRED', updated_at = NOW()\nWHERE animal_id = ?
DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功

AnimalService -> NotificationService: create_notification(\ntype='ANIMAL_RETIRED',\nuser_id=animal.created_by,\nrelated_id=animal_id)
activate NotificationService
NotificationService -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications
DB --> NotificationService: notification created
NotificationService --> AnimalService: notification
deactivate NotificationService

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal (已下架)
deactivate AnimalService

AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {'message': '動物已下架', 'animal': animal.to_dict()}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: success response
deactivate AnimalAPI

Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示成功提示
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals() 重新載入列表
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadStats() 更新統計
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示「動物已下架」訊息\n列表已更新
deactivate Dashboard

note right
  下架流程:
  1. 權限檢查 (管理員或送養者本人)
  2. 狀態驗證 (只能下架 PUBLISHED)
  3. 更新狀態為 RETIRED
  4. 發送通知
  5. 下架的動物不再顯示在公開列表
end note

== 5. 批次操作 - 批次核准發布 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 選擇多個待審核動物\n(toggleAnimal 勾選)
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: selectedAnimals[] 記錄選中的 ID
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示批次操作按鈕\n「批次核准發布 (N隻)」

Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「批次核准發布」按鈕
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示確認對話框\n「確定要批次核准發布 N 隻動物嗎？」
Admin -> Dashboard: 確認批次核准

Dashboard -> Dashboard: batchOperation('publish')
Dashboard -> Dashboard: batchProcessing = true

loop 對每個選中的動物 ID
    Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: publishAnimal(animalId)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{animalId}/publish
    activate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: publish_animal(animal_id, admin)
    activate AnimalService
    AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='PUBLISHED'
    DB --> AnimalService: success
    AnimalService -> NotificationService: create_notification(ANIMAL_PUBLISHED)
    activate NotificationService
    NotificationService -> DB: INSERT notification
    DB --> NotificationService: created
    deactivate NotificationService
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: success
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: success (successCount++)
    deactivate AnimalAPI
    
    alt 某個動物處理失敗
        Dashboard -> Dashboard: failedCount++\nerrors.push(錯誤訊息)
    end
end

Dashboard -> Dashboard: batchProcessing = false
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示批次結果\n「成功: N隻, 失敗: M隻」
Dashboard -> Dashboard: selectedAnimals = []\n清空選擇
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals()\nloadStats()
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示批次操作結果訊息\n列表已更新
deactivate Dashboard

note right
  批次操作特性:
  1. 支援批次核准發布
  2. 支援批次下架
  3. 支援批次拒絕
  4. 逐一處理每個動物
  5. 統計成功與失敗數量
  6. 顯示詳細錯誤訊息
  7. 失敗不影響其他動物繼續處理
end note

== 6. 批次操作 - 批次拒絕 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 選擇多個待審核動物
activate Dashboard
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「批次拒絕」按鈕

Dashboard -> Dashboard: openBatchRejectModal()\nisBatchReject = true
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示批次拒絕 Modal\n(列出選中的動物名稱)

Admin -> Dashboard: 填寫統一的拒絕原因
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選「確認批次拒絕」

Dashboard -> Dashboard: 驗證拒絕原因不為空
Dashboard -> Dashboard: batchProcessing = true

loop 對每個選中的動物 ID
    Dashboard -> AnimalAPI: rejectAnimal(animalId, rejectionReason)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{animalId}/reject\n{rejection_reason}
    activate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: reject_animal(animal_id, admin, reason)
    activate AnimalService
    AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status='DRAFT', rejection_reason=?
    DB --> AnimalService: success
    AnimalService -> NotificationService: create_notification(ANIMAL_REJECTED)
    activate NotificationService
    NotificationService -> DB: INSERT notification
    DB --> NotificationService: created
    deactivate NotificationService
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: success
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: success (successCount++)
    deactivate AnimalAPI
    
    alt 某個動物處理失敗
        Dashboard -> Dashboard: failedCount++\nerrors.push(錯誤訊息)
    end
end

Dashboard -> Dashboard: batchProcessing = false
Dashboard -> Dashboard: closeRejectModal()
Dashboard -> Dashboard: 顯示批次結果\n「成功: N隻, 失敗: M隻」
Dashboard -> Dashboard: selectedAnimals = []\n清空選擇
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals()\nloadStats()
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示批次拒絕結果訊息\n列表已更新
deactivate Dashboard

note right
  批次拒絕特點:
  1. 所有選中動物使用相同拒絕原因
  2. 顯示選中動物名稱供確認
  3. 拒絕原因為必填欄位
  4. 逐一處理並記錄結果
  5. 每個動物都會收到通知
end note

== 7. 切換狀態頁籤 ==
Admin -> Dashboard: 點選不同狀態頁籤\n(例: 「已發布」、「已下架」)
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard: currentStatus = 選中的狀態
Dashboard -> Dashboard: selectedAnimals = []\n清空選擇
Dashboard -> Dashboard: loadAnimals(status=currentStatus)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals?status={currentStatus}
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animals(filters)
activate AnimalService
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE status = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> AnimalService: animals[]
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animals[]
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animals[], total}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Dashboard: animals[]
deactivate AnimalAPI
Dashboard --> Admin: 顯示對應狀態的動物列表\n(操作按鈕根據狀態變化)
deactivate Dashboard

note right
  不同狀態頁籤顯示不同操作:
  - 待審核 (SUBMITTED): 核准/拒絕
  - 已發布 (PUBLISHED): 下架
  - 草稿 (DRAFT): 無管理操作
  - 已下架 (RETIRED): 無管理操作
  
  支援批次操作的狀態:
  - SUBMITTED: 批次核准、批次拒絕
  - PUBLISHED: 批次下架
end note

@enduml